recommend keep-going the next mechanical lap needs no word: four advisory families the same meter already counts and prints -- grep -P 6, readlink -f 5, sed -i 5, stat -c 2 -- each a measured list rather than a remembered one. Every remaining open red is Keaton's: %230 and %252 want the row-number ruling, %248 the integration word with three packages now parked behind it, %255 the send-order choice.
